       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. EXCEL-COLUMN-TITLE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 LETTERS     PIC X(26) VALUE "ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ".
       01 N           PIC 9(4) VALUE 701.
       01 REM-VAL     PIC 9(2).
       01 TITLE-BUF   PIC X(8) VALUE SPACES.
       01 POS         PIC 9 VALUE 8.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM UNTIL N = 0
               SUBTRACT 1 FROM N
               COMPUTE REM-VAL = FUNCTION MOD(N, 26) + 1
               MOVE LETTERS(REM-VAL:1) TO TITLE-BUF(POS:1)
               SUBTRACT 1 FROM POS
               COMPUTE N = N / 26
           END-PERFORM
           DISPLAY "TITLE = " FUNCTION TRIM(TITLE-BUF)
           STOP RUN.
